  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Mana sphere, Warp sphere (Plane Manipulator).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When creating any manabond, you may spend an additional spell point to lock the dimensional properties of the bond. As long as the manabond holds, both the host and recipient of the manabond are affected by a dimensional anchor, as per the Plane Manipulator talent.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mana#toc105\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
